  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive). No pair verb. Pattern: X⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧Y⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{貸|か}す (lend Y to X).\n\nASPECT: て⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ indicates ongoing state. ⟦{貸|か}し→貸し：02578_kashi⟧て⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ = 'have lent (still lending)' or 'is lending.'\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{本|ほん}→本：00111_hon⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{貸|か}す (lend a book)\n- ⟦{貸|か}し→貸し：02578_kashi⟧て⟦ください→下さい：02899_kudasai⟧ (please lend me)\n- ⟦{貸|か}し{出|だ}し→貸出：03043_kashidashi⟧ (lending/checkout - noun)\n- ⟦お{金|かね}→お金：00611_okane⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{貸|か}す (lend money)\n\nOpposite: ⟦{借|か}りる→借りる：00532_kariru⟧ (to borrow).",
